      "cooked": "<p>I have created a Custom HTML Block for fetching the company assigned to that particular user. It is fetching the company for the user with System Manager role but it is not fetching for any other roles.<br>\nResponse is always empty object.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/7/d73fccb792622fc13bbf067eb613654041574d4e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d73fccb792622fc13bbf067eb613654041574d4e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d73fccb792622fc13bbf067eb613654041574d4e_2_690x294.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uIbltggpkEEaww6jWFBkM9BZwmO\" width=\"690\" height=\"294\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d73fccb792622fc13bbf067eb613654041574d4e_2_690x294.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d73fccb792622fc13bbf067eb613654041574d4e_2_1035x441.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/7/d73fccb792622fc13bbf067eb613654041574d4e_2_1380x588.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"AECEF1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×819 47.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/4/94fd223ef34f9e2e97e6655a4cdf2a1d765f4776.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/94fd223ef34f9e2e97e6655a4cdf2a1d765f4776\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/4/94fd223ef34f9e2e97e6655a4cdf2a1d765f4776_2_690x294.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lg108Aq6kjdZzSF6r1rMkEkXWd0\" width=\"690\" height=\"294\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/4/94fd223ef34f9e2e97e6655a4cdf2a1d765f4776_2_690x294.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/4/94fd223ef34f9e2e97e6655a4cdf2a1d765f4776_2_1035x441.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/4/94fd223ef34f9e2e97e6655a4cdf2a1d765f4776_2_1380x588.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"ADCDF0\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×819 46.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>On user’s account instead of showing company name it shows No company assigned. Here you can see<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/4/44432447f81c6c5d8001509256b08b8df542fdf3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/44432447f81c6c5d8001509256b08b8df542fdf3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/44432447f81c6c5d8001509256b08b8df542fdf3_2_690x292.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9JSjKc4EHu42rct2BAjxUAPt8PN\" width=\"690\" height=\"292\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/44432447f81c6c5d8001509256b08b8df542fdf3_2_690x292.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/44432447f81c6c5d8001509256b08b8df542fdf3_2_1035x438.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/4/44432447f81c6c5d8001509256b08b8df542fdf3_2_1380x584.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"93C0F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1917×812 52.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I have also assigned necessary read permissions for User Permissions doctype for all the roles but still it is not working.</p>\n<p>Can anyone please help me out with this?</p>",
