      "id": 480824,
      "username": "SherinKR",
      "name": "Sherin K R",
      "created_at": "2025-09-16T09:49:48.679Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Try by using any of the following if you having Session Defaults</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>frappe.user_defaults.company<br>\nfrappe.defaults.get_user_default(“Company”)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>It will return the default company for that specific user.</p>\n<p>Alternatively you can just use like this</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.db.get_list('Company').then(records =&gt; {\n     // records[0].name will return company name\n})\n</code></pre>",
